{"data":{"id":33251,"name":"World Liberty Financial","symbol":"WLFI","slug":"world-liberty-financial-wlfi","category":"token","description":"## World Liberty Financial ($WLFI)\n\n**Inspired by Trump, Powered by USD1. World Liberty Financial (WLFI)** is a hybrid finance protocol designed to bridge traditional banking infrastructure with decentralized finance (DeFi). Anchored by its USD-backed stablecoin **USD1** and governance token **$WLFI**, the platform aims to democratize access to capital, simplify digital asset usage, and promote financial inclusion across borders.\n\n### Key Features\n- **USD1 Stablecoin**: A fully reserved, dollar-pegged stablecoin deployed across Ethereum, BNB Chain, Solana, and Tron, enabling fast, low-cost global transactions.\n- **$WLFI Governance Token**: A non-transferable token used to vote on protocol upgrades, incentive structures, and ecosystem expansion.\n- **Real-World Adoption**: Billions in USD1 transactions, including institutional settlement deals, with reserves held by BitGo and verified through independent audits.\n\n### Mission\nWLFI seeks to replace legacy banking limitations with open, on-chain infrastructure—making financial tools accessible regardless of geography, status, or institutional gatekeeping.\n","dateAdded":"2024-10-01T02:34:47.000Z","actualTimeStart":"2025-09-01T12:00:00.000Z","status":"active","isBn":1,"subStatus":"normal","notice":"This is the official WLFI project backed by [Donald J. Trump](https://x.com/realDonaldTrump/status/1840772362209251611).","alertType":2,"alertLink":"","latestUpdateTime":"2026-10-19T06:45:00.000Z","watchCount":"86265","watchListRanking":441,"dateLaunched":"2025-09-01T00:00:00.000Z","latestAdded":false,"tags":[{"slug":"defi","name":"DeFi","category":"CATEGORY","status":1,"priority":3},{"slug":"ethereum-ecosystem","name":"Ethereum Ecosystem","category":"PLATFORM","status":1,"priority":3},{"slug":"solana-ecosystem","name":"Solana Ecosystem","category":"PLATFORM","status":1,"priority